{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "0a3401d9a814935a819c1f418b4aa1d1085dfe4bfa3e630418e0298f0dcd81d1", "ja": "キラキラしてて……キレイ……♪\nでも、なんだか……。", "zh": "闪闪发光的……好漂亮……♪\n不过，总觉得……有点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
