{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "6716336a112031ea3d9db746946feb87b907058b3872da109a7e142b2e86e536", "ja": "アバターの服に、似たのがあったけど……杏奈が、着る\nなんて……。うれしい、けど……なんか不思議……。", "zh": "虽然在头像服装里见过类似的……但让杏奈穿上这种衣服……还是很开心，可是……总觉得有点不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7b35631fa07d42cbc6790063cf16952af56cc985ac64edc50aec50565af1f3cd", "ja": "そうか……。杏奈くらいの年齢だと、実際の結婚式より\nゲームや漫画の世界の結婚式の方が身近かもな。", "zh": "这样啊……。像杏奈这个年纪，游戏或漫画世界里的婚礼，可能比现实中的婚礼更熟悉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "ec21db017ee82ee8eeae684f42c6a6c8db5490f258ea65f007f01de4c1aa92d3", "ja": "ん……。ゲームでは、\nアイテム目当てで……結婚してた、けど……。", "zh": "嗯……在游戏里，是为了道具……才结婚的……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "2e7b842ee1412ddb5b09e1315da973d1ed6fedb1aa705c898e42aa00918e3e54", "ja": "ドレスを着ると……全然、違う……。\n結婚式って……すごく、特別……なんだなって……。", "zh": "穿上婚纱后……完全不一样……。\n我觉得……婚礼……真的是非常特别……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "01cbe2fdb27aabd4f16727f888a8d6353a90437047c626e65ca5a3139f606e18", "ja": "キレイなドレス……すごくうれしい、けど……。\n同じくらい……ドキドキ、してる……。", "zh": "漂亮的礼服……真的很开心，可是……\n也同样……让人心里怦怦跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fa7c995ad5d229b8b8620cce63f08e239c9aae4784ef8b41f9f76d4ea4436f1f", "ja": "そうだな。花嫁さんにとっては、アイドルの初めての\nステージと同じくらい、大事な出来事だからな。", "zh": "是啊。对新娘来说，这是和偶像第一次登台同等重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "576101961fad6dd0169b89dcc52b5a74c3de1ee1acbf8b578e5e8973bea881ed", "ja": "初めての、ステージ……。……そっか。杏奈、\nこの衣装で……ステージに、上がるんだ、よね……。", "zh": "第一次的舞台……原来如此。杏奈要穿着这套服装……登上舞台……对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "8e454c7f3990b02e02b5602b1002eb8ea931e1104f903b9f153d1bce6dab92fa", "ja": "……なんか、胸が……ぎゅってして……。\n大丈夫……かな……？", "zh": "……总觉得，胸口……好难受……\n真的能……顺利吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e23a1a8e09f15c2576e65c14f3936533da6976f29bf2b882c87c3fedb216dd19", "ja": "杏奈……。\n不安なことがあるなら、いつでも話聞くよ。", "zh": "杏奈……\n如果你有什么不安的事，随时都可以跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "969fb2a5ccbaf9dc374ed2c7b2e40c645b6abc77c5dcfde00664aff20835a603", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん……。\nあのね……杏奈……よく、わからなくて……。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生……\n那个……杏奈……经常搞不明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
