{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "750f5e6ae0c9d957ecc0660002f2f84978f8ed953c7b5810078cb29ba84c3c0d", "ja": "うん……。花嫁さんの、気持ち……。結婚式で……\n永遠の幸せを、誓うのって……どんな、かなって……。", "zh": "嗯……新娘的心情……在婚礼上宣誓永远幸福……究竟是什么样的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1015_p", "source_sha256": "50b5b77351bee85d1fafb75daca6d2997b39b1f8028b8e04633d9cecde468f38", "ja": "そうだな……。花嫁さんの誓いって、\n「幸せになる」という決意みたいなものだと思うんだ。", "zh": "是啊……我觉得，新娘的誓言就像是“要获得幸福”的决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0384_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1f7a34e368cc309499f2ba600ee39e266a7156e03fe0b987b8b1e94bdf9dd785", "ja": "杏奈は花嫁さんじゃなくて、アイドルだ。だから\n『アイドルとしての幸せ』を誓ってみるのはどうかな？", "zh": "杏奈不是新娘，而是偶像。所以，要不要试着立下“作为偶像的幸福”这样的誓言？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
